{"3738090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deiity (Under Ice)", "steam_appid": 3738090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakened at the bottom of god's frozen temple, use magical spells, weapons, and charms to fight your way to the top in order to prevent humanity from  ascending into godhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deiity Under Ice is a first person combat game where working smart beats working hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/4ba01ac75f4cfcd1f37d8ef9cb16dfad.poster.avif?t=1788191699\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/4ba01ac75f4cfcd1f37d8ef9cb16dfad.webm?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/4ba01ac75f4cfcd1f37d8ef9cb16dfad.mp4?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons and find secrets as you ascend through the 8 floors of the temple (and many secret levels!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with a sandbox of weapons, spells, and passive charms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual wield weapons and spells that compliment each-other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to permanently upgrade your gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/1819d70c35b466960a64aff3b5255f39.poster.avif?t=1788191699\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/1819d70c35b466960a64aff3b5255f39.webm?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/1819d70c35b466960a64aff3b5255f39.mp4?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend mana to kill enemies, kill enemies to gain mana</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange tokens for weapons, or save them to become stronger later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance use of weapons and spells to get the most bang out of your buck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/65614ba5f428ea5991b2ba160c9e342f.poster.avif?t=1788191699\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/65614ba5f428ea5991b2ba160c9e342f.webm?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/65614ba5f428ea5991b2ba160c9e342f.mp4?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle many unique enemies, no two feel the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover their strengths and weaknesses, and leverage them for your benefit</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you decide to play, thank you!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakened at the bottom of god's frozen temple, use magical spells, weapons, and charms to fight your way to the top in order to prevent humanity from  ascending into godhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deiity Under Ice is a first person combat game where working smart beats working hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/4ba01ac75f4cfcd1f37d8ef9cb16dfad.poster.avif?t=1788191699\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/4ba01ac75f4cfcd1f37d8ef9cb16dfad.webm?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/4ba01ac75f4cfcd1f37d8ef9cb16dfad.mp4?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons and find secrets as you ascend through the 8 floors of the temple (and many secret levels!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with a sandbox of weapons, spells, and passive charms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual wield weapons and spells that compliment each-other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to permanently upgrade your gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/1819d70c35b466960a64aff3b5255f39.poster.avif?t=1788191699\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/1819d70c35b466960a64aff3b5255f39.webm?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/1819d70c35b466960a64aff3b5255f39.mp4?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend mana to kill enemies, kill enemies to gain mana</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange tokens for weapons, or save them to become stronger later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance use of weapons and spells to get the most bang out of your buck</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/65614ba5f428ea5991b2ba160c9e342f.poster.avif?t=1788191699\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/65614ba5f428ea5991b2ba160c9e342f.webm?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/extras/65614ba5f428ea5991b2ba160c9e342f.mp4?t=1788191699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle many unique enemies, no two feel the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover their strengths and weaknesses, and leverage them for your benefit</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you decide to play, thank you!</p>", "short_description": "A dungeon crawler about working smart, not hard. As a fallen god, climb a buried antarctic temple to use humanities own weapons to destroy the earth. Use magic abilities to manipulate physics, enemies, and the environment as you fight man-made biological creations. The temple's secrets await.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/dfed6c2b7201b77adca8910133553eaf0efef7f2/header.jpg?t=1788191699", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738090/5739129e3b7f832c261e852c5321c4a9e32c2f5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788191699", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/373809